ng.","zh":"你好！我是马克。","unit":5},{"en":"Hi, Mark! This is John. What's the weather like in Sydney?","zh":"嗨，马克！我是约翰。悉尼的天气怎","unit":5},{"en":"Well, it's sunny today.","zh":"噢，今天是晴天。","unit":5},{"en":"It's only two degrees in Beijing.","zh":"北京只有两度。","unit":5},{"en":"It's raining now.","zh":"现在下雨了。","unit":5},{"en":"We can't play basketball in the park.","zh":"我们不能在公园打篮球了。","unit":5},{"en":"It's OK. We can go to the library.","zh":"没关系。我们可以去图书馆。","unit":5},{"en":"It's hot and sunny here.","zh":"这里很热，是个大晴天。","unit":5},{"en":"Their children swim in the pool.","zh":"他们的孩子在泳池里游泳。","unit":5},{"en":"Whose sweater is this, Mum?","zh":"这是谁的毛衣，妈？","unit":6},{"en":"It's your dad's.","zh":"是你爸的。","unit":6},{"en":"Can I wear this new shirt today?","zh":"我今天可以穿这件新衬衫吗？","unit":6},{"en":"Yes, but wear a coat too. It's cold and windy outside.","zh":"可以，但是再穿一件外套吧。外面有","unit":6},{"en":"Which season do you like?","zh":"你喜欢哪个季节？","unit":6},{"en":"Winter. It snows a lot.","zh":"冬天。冬天经常下雪。","unit":6},{"en":"I like winter too. There are many festivals.","zh":"我也喜欢冬天。（在冬天）有很多","unit":6},{"en":"It's full of life.","zh":"（春天）充满生机。","unit":6},{"en":"And enjoy mooncakes.","zh":"还品尝月饼。","unit":6},{"en":"Then spring comes again.","zh":"接着春天又来了。","unit":6},{"en":"Hurry up! Don't be late for class!","zh":"快点！上课别迟到！","unit":1},{"en":"I'm ready. Let's go!","zh":"我准备好了。我们走吧！","unit":1},{"en":"Who's on duty today?","zh":"今天谁值日？","unit":1},{"en":"I can put back the desks and chairs.","zh":"我可以把桌椅放回原位。","unit":1},{"en":"Excuse me?","zh":"对不起，请再说一次可以吗？","unit":1},{"en":"Mum, can I watch TV?","zh":"妈，我能看电视吗？","unit":2},{"en":"No. You have to do your homework first.","zh":"不行。你得先做作业。","unit":2},{"en":"Shh. Don 't be so loud!","zh":"嘘。别这么大声！","unit":2},{"en":"Be careful, Jack. Don 't touch hot things.","zh":"杰克，要小心。别碰烫的东西。","unit":2},{"en":"What time is it?","zh":"几点了？","unit":3},{"en":"It 's 5 o'clock.","zh":"现在五点了。","unit":3},{"en":"Time to go home, kids.","zh":"孩子们，该回家了。","unit":3},{"en":"It's time for dinner.","zh":"该吃晚饭了。","unit":3},{"en":"It 's time to get up.","zh":"该起床了。","unit":3},{"en":"Have a nice day!","zh":"祝你一天愉快！","unit":3},{"en":"Can I buy a new pair?","zh":"我能买条新的（裤子）吗？","unit":4},{"en":"Sure. Let 's go to the clothes shop.","zh":"当然。我们去服装店吧。","unit":4},{"en":"You already have too many shorts. Let's buy trousers.","zh":"你已经有很多短裤了。我们买长裤吧。","unit":4},{"en":"Can I help you?","zh":"要帮忙吗？","unit":4},{"en":"Yes. I like this pink dress.","zh":"嗯。我喜欢这件粉色的长裙。","unit":4},{"en":"Let's take it.","zh":"我们买下它吧。","unit":4},{"en":"NÅON*Nº[fN`Ou(ÿ g*~ÏcgCN _SæPZNÖu( ===== PAGE 38 ===== 87","zh":"您的农场上都养了哪些动物？","unit":5},{"en":"I have a lot of animals.","zh":"我养了很多动物。","unit":5},{"en":"What are these?","zh":"这些是什么？","unit":5},{"en":"They're tomatoes.","zh":"这些是西红柿。","unit":5},{"en":"How fresh!","zh":"真新鲜啊！","unit":5},{"en":"Let's feed the chickens.","zh":"我们喂鸡吧。","unit":6},{"en":"Can you please pass me the vegetables?","zh":"能否请你把蔬菜递给我？","unit":6},{"en":"Mike, Amy, would you like a knife and fork?","zh":"迈克、埃米，你们需要餐刀和餐叉吗？","unit":6},{"en":"No, thank you, Mr Wang. I can use chopsticks.","zh":"不用，谢您，王先生。我会用筷子。","unit":6},{"en":"Don't waste food, please.","zh":"请不要浪费食物。","unit":6}]}}}